{"id":1130901,"name":"시슬·심문 I","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"시슬·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1130901]}],"trial":{"trial_id":130901,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2024-04-08 14:00:00","diary1":"화원 수용 사건의 여파가 계속되고 있다. 당신을 향한 암살에 의해 관리국이 혼란에 빠졌을 때 불청객 한 명이 잠입해 당신을 죽이려고 한다.","diary2":"시슬의 암살 계획은 실패로 돌아갔지만 코쿠리코와 똑같이 당신은 그녀가 왜 이렇게까지 단호하고 집요하게 당신을 죽이려고 하는지 당신은 알 수 없었다.\n　　아니, 당신은 알고 있을지도 모른다. 그녀가 실패한 원인에 대해 생각해보니, 그녀가 가져온 것은 위기뿐만 아니라 돌파구도 있다는 것을 알아차릴 수 있었다.","evidence":[{"ID":260545,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260546,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230901023,"next":null},{"step":24,"